  "metadata": {
    "title": "PyFuga: Python implementation of the Fuga linearised wake model",
    "description": "<p>PyFuga is an open-source Python implementation of the Fuga linearised CFD wake model and lookup table (LUT) generator for wind turbine wakes.</p><p>Source code repository (and issue tracker): <a href=\"https://gitlab.windenergy.dtu.dk/TOPFARM/PyFuga\">https://gitlab.windenergy.dtu.dk/TOPFARM/PyFuga</a></p><p>Documentation and installation guides: <a href=\"https://topfarm.pages.windenergy.dtu.dk/PyFuga/main/index.html\">https://topfarm.pages.windenergy.dtu.dk/PyFuga/main/index.html</a></p>",
